@startuml
title v0.6 - Explore three gardens and collect three keys
start
:Choose one shared character;
:Home map - Dhikr or journey of the good heart;
:Open journey of the good heart;
repeat
  :Open next available garden;
  if (Intro segment already completed?) then (yes)
  else (no)
    :Play only configured range;
    if (Playback and completion save succeed?) then (yes)
    else (no)
      :Keep progress; offer retry;
      stop
    endif
  endif
  repeat
    :Show original scene and three live choices;
    :Choose any response;
    :Read supportive explanation;
    :Optional exploration of other responses;
    :Deliberately continue;
    if (Local commit succeeds?) then (yes)
      :Record challenge once;
    else (no)
      :Keep screen and prior progress;
      stop
    endif
  repeat while (Fewer than five explored?) is (yes)
  :Award garden key once;
  :Optional private writing;
repeat while (Fewer than three keys?) is (yes)
:Open treasure ending;
:Optional daily plan and practice;
stop
@enduml
